      "findings": [
        "Selected 240,000 lb MTOW column is consistent with model MLW 198,000 lb, MZFW 184,000 lb, 186-seat two-class cabin, 42,684 L fuel and 51 m3 lower-deck cargo.",
        "Spec OEW is 60,001 kg RB211 versus 59,357 kg PW in that column; OEW rows describe typical as-delivered or as-offered configurations and refer the reader to the operator for actual weights.",
        "RB211 OEW across weight variants is non-monotonic, so a generic heavy-aircraft scale factor cannot be inferred from the table alone.",
        "PR chart MZFW limit is 188,000 lb, broader than the selected 184,000 lb base column; chart ZFW includes OEW plus payload."
      ],
